      </a>

      <div class="navbar-links">
        <a href="#features">Fonctionnalites</a>
        <a href="#modules">Modules</a>
        <a href="#stats">Statistiques</a>
        <a href="#cta">Contact</a>
      </div>

      <div class="navbar-actions">
        <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="btn-outline">Connexion</a>
        <a href="{{ path('app_register') }}" class="btn-primary">S'inscrire</a>
      </div>

      <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="Menu">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6" />
          <line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12" />
          <line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18" />
        </svg>
      </button>
    </nav>
    <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
      <a href="#features">Fonctionnalites</a>
      <a href="#modules">Modules</a>
      <a href="#stats">Statistiques</a>
      <a href="#cta">Contact</a>
      <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="btn-outline" style="text-align:center;margin-top:8px;">Connexion</a>
      <a href="{{ path('app_register') }}" class="btn-primary" style="text-align:center;">S'inscrire</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>

    <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-glow"></div>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-badge">
          <span class="hero-badge-dot"></span>
          <span>Assistant Intelligent de Vie</span>
        </div>

        <h1>
          Centralisez toute votre <span class="highlight">gestion personnelle</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-sub">
          Sante, finances, temps, taches, objectifs et habitudes. LifeOps reunit tout ce dont vous avez besoin pour piloter votre vie quotidienne avec intelligence.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="{{ path('app_register') }}" class="btn-primary-lg">
            Commencer gratuitement
            <svg class="arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#modules" class="btn-outline-lg">Decouvrir les modules</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-stats">
          <div>
            <p class="stat-value">5</p>
            <p class="stat-label">Modules integres</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="stat-value">100%</p>
            <p class="stat-label">Gratuit</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="stat-value">24/7</p>
            <p class="stat-label">Accessible</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="stat-value">IA</p>
            <p class="stat-label">Recommandations</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== FEATURES ===== -->
    <section id="features" class="section">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="section-header">
          <p class="section-tag">Fonctionnalites</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">Tout ce qu'il faut pour une vie bien organisee</h2>
          <p class="section-desc">LifeOps combine intelligence artificielle et design intuitif pour vous aider a reprendre le controle.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="features-grid">
          <!-- AI -->
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z"/><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z"/><path d="M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4"/><path d="M12 18v-6"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Intelligence artificielle</h3>
            <p>Recommandations personnalisees basees sur vos habitudes et donnees pour optimiser chaque aspect de votre vie.</p>
          </div>
          <!-- All-in-one -->
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Tout-en-un</h3>
            <p>Plus besoin de jongler entre plusieurs applications. Sante, finances, taches, temps : tout est centralise.</p>
          </div>
          <!-- Security -->
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Securite et confidentialite</h3>
            <p>Vos donnees personnelles sont protegees avec un chiffrement de bout en bout et une authentification biometrique.</p>
          </div>
          <!-- Analytics -->
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"/><path d="M7 16l4-8 4 4 6-8"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Bilans et analyses</h3>
            <p>Tableaux de bord detailles, scores de forme, risque de burnout et suivi de progression en temps reel.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== MODULES ===== -->
    <section id="modules" class="section">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="section-header">
          <p class="section-tag">Modules</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">Cinq modules pour piloter votre vie</h2>
          <p class="section-desc">Chaque domaine de votre vie personnelle merite une attention particuliere. LifeOps les reunit tous.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="modules-grid">
          <!-- Health -->
          <div class="module-card">
            <div class="module-bar" style="background:#e8447a;"></div>
            <div class="module-body">
              <div class="module-icon" style="background:rgba(232,68,122,0.12);">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#e8447a" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="module-content">
                <h3>Suivi de sante</h3>
                <span class="module-tag" style="background:rgba(232,68,122,0.1);color:#e8447a;">Sante</span>
                <p>Bilans de sante, niveaux de fatigue et stress, score de forme, detection du risque de burnout.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Finances -->
          <div class="module-card">
            <div class="module-bar" style="background:#10b981;"></div>
            <div class="module-body">
              <div class="module-icon" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,0.12);">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3"/><path d="M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="module-content">
                <h3>Gestion financiere</h3>
                <span class="module-tag" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,0.1);color:#10b981;">Finances</span>
                <p>Budgets mensuels, suivi des depenses par categorie, economies et plafonds automatiques.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Time -->
          <div class="module-card">
            <div class="module-bar" style="background:#0ea5e9;"></div>
            <div class="module-body">
              <div class="module-icon" style="background:rgba(14,165,233,0.12);">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0ea5e9" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="module-content">
                <h3>Gestion du temps</h3>
                <span class="module-tag" style="background:rgba(14,165,233,0.1);color:#0ea5e9;">Temps</span>
                <p>Planning journalier, disponibilites, activites priorisees et estimation des horaires.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Tasks -->
          <div class="module-card">
